<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-North year net profit slips.</title>
<headline>RTRS-North year net profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   217.27 vs 223.32</p>
<p>    Net				    111.89 vs 116.37</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		9.0 vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     13.0 vs 13.0</p>
<p>NOTE: North Ltd is a mining and forestry group.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.08 vs 1.00</p>
<p>    Other income			  64.88 vs 87.53</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   16.10 vs 17.30</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss 11.93 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Sept 30</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 16</p>
<p>    Tax				     64.75 vs 88.13</p>
<p>    Interest				39.02 vs 28.59</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  99.65 vs 66.04</p>
<p>    Minorities			    28.70 vs 18.82</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
